    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.23,
      349.03,
      455.3,
      396.5
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2:This clause inserts a new sub section (1A) immediately after subsection (1) ofsection 2 in the Betting and Gaming Levy Act, No. 40 of 1988 (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cPrincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of the insertion of thenew subsection is to providefor the imposition of a levy at the rate of five per centum in respect of each month on thegross collection of the businesses of bookmaking and gaming.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.23,
      406.63,
      455.28,
      434.9
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3:This clause inserts a new section 2A immediately after section 2 in theprincipal enactment. The new section provides for the registration of businesses of book-making and gaming.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.23,
      445.03,
      455.38,
      463.7
    ],
    "text": "Clause 4:This clause inserts a definition for \u201cperson\u201d immdiately after the definition of\u201cgaming\u201d in the principal enactment.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.23,
      473.83,
      455.26,
      492.5
    ],
    "text": "Clause 5:This clause includes the amount of levy chargeable for every year commenc-ing on or after April 1, 2013.",
