      192.21,
      226.85,
      371.49,
      250.19
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE BETTING AND GAMING LEVYAct, No. 40 of 1988",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      262.85,
      401.9,
      286.19
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      298.85,
      401.87,
      346.19
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Betting and GamingLevy (Amendment) Act, No. of 2013 and shall bedeemed for all purposes to have come into operation onJanuary 1, 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      358.85,
      401.9,
      418.19
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 2 of the Betting and Gaming Levy Act, No.40 of 1988 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d), as last amended by Act, No.9 of 2005 is herebyamended by the insertion immediately after subsection (1)of that section of the following new subsection:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      185.85,
      430.85,
      401.92,
      502.19
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(1A) Every person who is liable to pay the levyunder subsection (1) shall, in addition to the paymentof such levy, be charged a levy at the rate of five percentum, on the gross collection of the businessesreferred to in paragraphs (a) or (b) of subsection (1)carried on by him in respect of each month:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      185.85,
      514.85,
      401.87,
      586.19
    ],
    "text": "Provided however, the person who is liable to paythe levy under this subsection, shall not be liable topay the Value Added Tax under the Value Added TaxAct, No.14 of 2002 or the Nation Building Tax underthe Nation Building Tax Act, No.9 of 2009, on suchcollection:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      185.85,
      598.85,
      401.88,
      670.19
    ],
    "text": "Provided further, that any person whose grosscollection in respect of the businesses referred to inparagraphs (a) or (b) of subsection (1) does not exceedtwelve million per annum or three million per quarter,such person shall not be liable to pay the levy requiredto be paid under this subsection.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      300.35,
      454.3,
      328.41
    ],
